flowchart TD
    Input[role, type, prior questions/feedback plus final answer] --> Prompt[summaryPrompt]
    Input -. current feedback not attached yet .-> Caveat[Controller attaches final feedback after graph returns]
    Prompt --> LLM[ChatGroq llm.invoke]
    LLM --> Clean[Strip JSON fences]
    Clean --> Parse{JSON.parse}
    Parse -->|Success| Output[overallScore, summary, strengths, weaknesses, recommendations]
    Parse -->|Failure| Catch[Catch block]
    LLM -->|Invocation error| Catch
    Catch --> Scope[References response outside try scope]
    Scope --> Mask[Possible ReferenceError]
